# RTL & i18n — applies to UI files

- Arabic-first. The app defaults to Arabic with full RTL; English is secondary.
- Tailwind logical properties ONLY: `ps`/`pe`, `ms`/`me`, `text-start`/`text-end`, `start-0`/`end-0`.
  NEVER directional utilities: `pl`/`pr`/`ml`/`mr`/`text-left`/`text-right`/`left-0`/`right-0`.
  Directional utilities break the Arabic layout — this is a hard rule, not a preference.
- Western digits (123) even in the Arabic UI.
- Tenant-authored content (pitch names, product names) is shown exactly as written, never translated.
- Verify the current next-intl API against its installed docs before writing i18n code.
